    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.15,
      203.09,
      397.19,
      275.99
    ],
    "text": "(2) Where in any group of relatives mentioned in thetable subjoined to rule 1, there are two or more persons ofthe same age or of different ages who are equally entitledand willing to succeed, the Divisional Secretary maynominate out of these persons who develop the land tosucceed to the holding:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.15,
      289.25,
      397.15,
      337.43
    ],
    "text": "Provided that when nominating more than one person,the successors should be nominated in accordance withany conditions that may have been included in the permitor the grant.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      358.85,
      451.16,
      398.18
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.Sinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.",
